# Vue / Nuxt

- Use `<script lang="ts" setup>` and Nuxt auto-imports (`useState`, `navigateTo`, `$fetch`).
- Club pages live under `app/pages/clubs/[clubname]/`; parent `[clubname].vue` loads club into `useState('club')` and uses layout `in-da-club`.
- `definePageMeta` for layout, name, validate, middleware — follow neighboring pages.
- Auth-gated paths use `middleware: 'auth-required'` or global `club-admin-reroute` for `/admin*`.
- Composables go in `app/composables/useX.ts`; utils in `app/utils/`.
- Import domain types from `~/types/frontend` (or `#shared/types/...` if already used nearby).
- Prefer kebab-case filenames; exception already exists: `telegramLoginButton.vue`.
